  "instructions": [
    "Bring beef broth to a boil in a large iron teppan or pot over high heat.",
    "Reduce heat to low and simmer for 5 minutes.",
    "Slice the onion and ginger and add to the pot.",
    "Slice the beef strips and cook in the pot for 3-4 minutes, or until browned.",
    "Add the fish sauce, soy sauce, and sugar to the pot and stir to combine.",
    "Cook the vermicelli rice noodles according to the package instructions and set aside.",
    "Add the cilantro, lime wedges, and sliced green onions to the pot and stir to combine.",
    "Serve the noodles in bowls and top with the beef and onion mixture.",
    "Garnish with bean sprouts and additional cilantro if desired.",
    "Serve immediately and enjoy!"
